     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Also, I am trying to do the Shapefile projection as per here: <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/camtrapR/vignettes/DataExploration.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/camtrapR/vignettes/DataExploration.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792452075605000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cWKRAWGojMHIXduzqUl2I\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/camtrapR/vignettes/DataExploration.html</a><br><pre style=\"background-color:rgb(247,247,247);border-radius:3px;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap;margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:10px;padding:10px;font-size:14px\"><code style=\"border-radius:3px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:11.9px\"> shapefileName       &lt;-<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\"> &quot;recordShapefileTest&quot;</span>\r\n shapefileProjection &lt;-<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\"> &quot;+proj=utm +zone=50 +ellps=WGS84 +datum=WGS84 +units=m +no_defs&quot;</span></code></pre><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>But, my coords are all in GPS. Any suggestions for the shapefileProjection format?</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
